# Trivy ignore list — each entry must be justified, scoped, and reviewed.
# Next review: 2026-11-17.

# msgpack 1.1.2 is pip's *vendored* copy (pip/_vendor/msgpack) inside the
# python:3.14-slim toolchain. The ShadowShield server never imports msgpack
# and pip is not invoked at container runtime, so the OOB-read is not
# reachable in the shipped process. Un-ignore as soon as upstream pip revendors
# msgpack >= 1.2.1, then upgrade pip in the Dockerfile.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# setuptools 70.3.0 remains detectable in the base image's interpreter layer
# (ensurepip/pkg toolchain) even though the runtime site-packages carries
# setuptools >= 78.1.1. The server does not import setuptools at runtime;
# the path-traversal is a build-tool issue, not a serving-path issue.
# Re-check after the next python:3.14-slim digest refresh.
CVE-2025-47273
